d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Suttles","x":"Our cash cost savings this year estimated at more than $200 million, increased by an additional $100 million next year, as our legacy costs are down significantly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/ovintiv-inc-de-ovv-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"OVV 2020 Q2","e":"ovv","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Corey Code","x":"Our total cost per barrel of oil equivalent were down 8% quarter-over-quarter and reflect the continued cost reduction efforts throughout the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/ovintiv-inc-de-ovv-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"OVV 2020 Q3","e":"ovv","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Suttles","x":"One of our most impactful achievements is the cost cutting that came from every part of the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/ovintiv-inc-de-ovv-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"OVV 2020 Q3","e":"ovv","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Suttles","x":"We have achieved more than $200 million of cost savings in 2020, and next year, we expect that to grow to $300 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/ovintiv-inc-de-ovv-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"OVV 2020 Q4","e":"ovv","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Suttles","x":"Our people found cost savings across every part of our business, and we exited 2020 a leaner and more profitable company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/ovintiv-inc-de-ovv-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"OVV 2020 Q4","e":"ovv","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Doug Suttles","x":"And for the third consecutive year, we generated free cash flow coming in at $193 million or about $285 million, if you include the one-time restructuring cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/ovintiv-inc-de-ovv-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"OVV 2021 Q1","e":"ovv","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Douglas James Suttles","x":"Our inventory essentially right now stays flat every year because through this application of innovation, technology and cost reduction, we unlock new opportunities, at least of the scale of the ones we drilled in the last year, creating a bit of a perpetual motion machine in this space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/ovintiv-inc-de-ovv-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"OVV 2021 Q2","e":"ovv","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendan McCracken","x":"…Greg highlighted, some of the same efficiency gains that we've been delivering elsewhere in the portfolio, we're now bringing to bear on the Bakken, and seeing great results both on the cost reduction side, but also on the well performance side, we're seeing really strong well performance there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/ovintiv-inc-ovv-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2021 Q3","e":"ovv","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Neal Dingmann","x":"You guys have done a great job in sort of taking cost out where others have seen inflation, it seems like to me, and I'm just wondering, could you talk about, is there ways to even more fully integrate that process to -- to have even more cost savings, or maybe you could just talk about along…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/ovintiv-inc-ovv-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2021 Q3","e":"ovv","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Neal Dingmann","x":"…have done a great job in sort of taking cost out where others have seen inflation, it seems like to me, and I'm just wondering, could you talk about, is there ways to even more fully integrate that process to -- to have even more cost savings, or maybe you could just talk about along those lines?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/ovintiv-inc-ovv-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2025 Q2","e":"ovv","d":"2025-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendan McCracken","x":"Our Montney asset integration went seamlessly as we successfully met our well cost reduction target in the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/ovintiv-ovv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2025 Q2","e":"ovv","d":"2025-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendan McCracken","x":"This has led to faster cycle times, more production, and significant cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/ovintiv-ovv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2025 Q2","e":"ovv","d":"2025-07-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Greg Givens","x":"We are also reducing our guide for full-year operating expense by about 3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/ovintiv-ovv-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2025 Q3","e":"ovv","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Greg Givens","x":"Year to date, as of the end of the second quarter, their pre-hedge gas price realization was approximately 180% of AECO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/ovintiv-ovv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2025 Q3","e":"ovv","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendan McCracken","x":"Collectively, these actions streamline and high-grade our portfolio, help us to meet or exceed our debt target, and uniquely position us with significant inventory duration in the two most valuable oil plays in North America, the Permian and the Montney.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/ovintiv-ovv-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OVV 2025 Q3","e":"ovv","d